    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Sarah Saleem, a distinguished public health expert and epidemiologist, has been appointed to the International Advisory Board (IAB) of the Lancet Global Health, one of the world's most influential medical journals. This prestigious role recognizes her extensive experience in global health and exceptional contributions to maternal and reproductive health, particularly in low- and middle-income countries.",
